  "description": "The application seeks planning permission for the replacement of the existing front roof slopes with a mansard roof form across Nos. 2–36 Calbourne Road. The proposed development involves the formation of a steeper lower roof plane set at approximately 70 degrees, with a flat roof section positioned behind the mansard face. Rooflights are proposed within the mansard plane, aligned consistently across the terrace. The existing ridge height will be retained and party wall heights will remain unaltered.The proposal has been designed as a comprehensive terrace-wide intervention, ensuring uniform alignment, consistent proportions and coordinated detailing. \n",
